# rail_plate_offset.cam/geometry.part — the land footprint, three faces at one height.
# Chorded from land.svg (one evenodd path; arcs to 0.01mm of sagitta; y flipped,
# SVG being y-down). A Face's inner loops may not nest, so the two rails that
# stand free INSIDE channel pockets are faces of their own:
#   Land      the main rail network: outer contour, 7 channel pockets, the
#             finger's slot, the corner fillet's pocket, 8 bolt holes
#   RingRail  the closed ring in the west pocket, its own pocket and bolt hole
#   BarRail   the 25 x 3 bar in the south pocket
